      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0B",
      "text": "Flow 2: Ingestion Progress\n\nFrontend: listen('ingestion-progress', handler)\n  \u2192 Rust: start_ingestion command \u2192 spawn Python\n  \u2192 Python: EMBED / TRAIN scripts emit JSON lines\n  \u2192 Rust: parse stdout \u2192 app_handle.emit('ingestion-progress', ...)\n  \u2190 Frontend: handler fires, updates progress UI",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box-flow2",
      "originalText": "Flow 2: Ingestion Progress\n\nFrontend: listen('ingestion-progress', handler)\n  \u2192 Rust: start_ingestion command \u2192 spawn Python\n  \u2192 Python: EMBED / TRAIN scripts emit JSON lines\n  \u2192 Rust: parse stdout \u2192 app_handle.emit('ingestion-progress', ...)\n  \u2190 Frontend: handler fires, updates progress UI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
