      "index": "b0D",
      "text": "Flow 3: Chat (Streaming)\n\nFrontend: Chat UI sends message\n  \u2192 Tauri: chat command bridge\n  \u2192 Rust: crates/inference spawn INFERENCE_DAEMON\n  \u2192 Python: MLX generate() with Qwen3.5 4-bit + LoRA\n  \u2190 Streaming tokens via stdout \u2192 Tauri events \u2192 UI",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box-flow3",
      "originalText": "Flow 3: Chat (Streaming)\n\nFrontend: Chat UI sends message\n  \u2192 Tauri: chat command bridge\n  \u2192 Rust: crates/inference spawn INFERENCE_DAEMON\n  \u2192 Python: MLX generate() with Qwen3.5 4-bit + LoRA\n  \u2190 Streaming tokens via stdout \u2192 Tauri events \u2192 UI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
