      "index": "b0F",
      "text": "Legend:  Blue = Frontend (React 19 + Zustand)    Purple = Tauri IPC Bridge (generate_handler![])    Green = Rust Backend (AppState/IngestionState + Tauri commands)    Orange = Python Subprocesses (MLX scripts)\n          Solid arrows = synchronous IPC / direct calls       Dashed arrows = subprocess spawn / stdout communication       One-way arrows = event emissions (backend \u2192 frontend)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend:  Blue = Frontend (React 19 + Zustand)    Purple = Tauri IPC Bridge (generate_handler![])    Green = Rust Backend (AppState/IngestionState + Tauri commands)    Orange = Python Subprocesses (MLX scripts)\n          Solid arrows = synchronous IPC / direct calls       Dashed arrows = subprocess spawn / stdout communication       One-way arrows = event emissions (backend \u2192 frontend)",
